      "component": "prompt enhancer",
      "help": "Rewrites the prompt with MiniMax's prompt enhancer (27B, thinking on) and picks an aspect for an auto canvas; it sees the references of the encode node its text feeds. Bypassed: the prompt and canvas pass through.",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "think",
